  "job_A2.2_20251003_114158": {
    "chunk_text": "Hw\u00e6t. Ic \u00feysne sang si\u00f0geomor fand on seocum sefan, samnode wide hu \u00fea \u00e6\u00f0elingas ellen cy\u00f0don, torhte ond Twelfe w\u00e6ron, d\u00e6dum domf\u00e6ste, dryhtne gecorene, leofe on life. Lof wide sprang, miht ond m\u00e6r\u00f0o, ofer middangeard, \u00feeodnes \u00feegna, \u00ferym unlytel. Halgan heape hlyt wisode \u00fe\u00e6r hie dryhtnes \u00e6 deman sceoldon, reccan fore rincum. Sume on Romebyrig, frame, fyrdhwate, feorh ofgefon \u00feurg Nerones nearwe searwe, Petrus ond Paulus. Is se apostolhad wide geweor\u00f0od ofer wer\u00feeoda. Swylce Andreas in Achagia for Egias aldre gene\u00f0de. Ne \u00fereodode he fore \u00ferymme \u00f0eodcyninges, \u00e6niges on eor\u00f0an, ac him ece geceas langsumre lif, leoht Hw\u00e6t, we eac gehyrdon be Iohanne \u00e6gl\u00e6awe menn \u00e6\u00f0elo reccan. Se manna w\u00e6s, mine gefrege, \u00feurh cneorisse Criste leofast on weres hade, sy\u00f0\u00f0an wuldres cyning, He in Effessia ealle \u00ferage leode l\u00e6rde, \u00feanon lifes weg si\u00f0e gesohte, swegle dreamas, beorhtne N\u00e6s his bro\u00f0or l\u00e6t, si\u00f0es s\u00e6ne, ac \u00f0urh sweordes bite mid Iudeum Iacob sceolde fore Herode ealdre Philipus w\u00e6s mid Asseum, \u00feanon ece lif \u00feurh rode cwealm ricene gesohte, sy\u00f0\u00f0an on galgan in Huru, wide wear\u00f0 wurd undyrne \u00fe\u00e6t to Indeum aldre gel\u00e6dde beaducr\u00e6ftig beorn, Bartholameus. \u00deone heht Astrias in Albano,",
